# createstuff.ai routing
#
# Before 2026-09-29 this project shipped no 404.html, so Cloudflare Pages fell
# back to index.html for EVERY unmatched URL — /anything returned HTTP 200 with
# the homepage in the body (a soft-404). Shipping 404.html fixed that.
#
# The sitemap used to advertise /app/, /pricing/, /templates/ and /guide/.
# None of them were ever separate files: the 2026 landing-page refresh replaced
# them with in-page sections (#cs-features, #cs-how, #cs-signin, #templates),
# but the sitemap was never updated. Those four URLs 301 to the homepage —
# which is exactly what they returned before — so no inbound link dies, while
# anything genuinely unknown now returns a real 404.
/app          /   301
/app/         /   301
/pricing      /   301
/pricing/     /   301
/templates    /   301
/templates/   /   301
/guide        /   301
/guide/       /   301
